    "collapsible_content_JWRDn8": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_b44n9F": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why are your perfumes so affordable?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>We focus on what really matters: the fragrance. No luxury bottles, no elaborate packaging, no costs for brick-and-mortar stores, and no expensive collaborations with influencers. This way, you can enjoy a high-quality perfume with a refined character without spending a fortune.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_rCVDnP": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is it an Eau de Parfum?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, it’s an Eau de Parfum—with a concentration of fragrance oils between 19% and 21%.</p><p>By comparison, an Eau de Toilette generally contains about 5–8%, while pure perfume extract starts at a concentration of about 41% and up.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_rNbx6p": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long does the perfume last?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>The scent generally lasts from 6 to 12 hours. It can vary from person to person, offering a balanced and intense fragrance for several hours. After that, the scent gradually fades.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_irweNa": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Does the inspired fragrance smell different?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>No, the fragrance faithfully recreates the original's scent profile, offering a very similar experience.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_gJVQkB": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What does “19–21% fragrance” mean?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>This means that the bottle contains up to 19–21% fragrance oils. </p><p>Original Eau de Parfum fragrances generally have a concentration ranging from 16% to 21%.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
